    {
      "id": "claim_c5cffdd594ef46948d9750737eaa141d",
      "statement": "billcollector/vault.py never calls sys.exit: it raises VaultAPIError and lets callers decide, where the batch entry point translates failures into its documented exit codes (vault preflight failure exits 1 before any vault call; a per-pair VaultAPIError aborts only that service/user pair and the process exits 1 at the end if any pair failed) and the daemon runner records the run as failure before the step loop starts.",
      "evidence": [
