    {
      "id": "claim_f893bfa505044409a1baaaa2d17d86fb",
      "statement": "Both operating modes share the same vault preflight semantics: the batch WebRetriDoc calls pinned_api_url(self.api, VAULT_MAX_ATTEMPTS, VAULT_RETRY_BACKOFF) and then requires bitwarden_api_check_status to report unlocked, and the daemon runner's _vault_preflight reads BW_API_URL from the environment (missing raises VaultTransportError), runs the same pinned_api_url preflight, requires an unlocked status, and fetches the task's credentials via fetch_credentials.",
